Source: sysible-branding
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sysible <maintainers@sysible.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: sysible-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sysible Server visual branding (SES)
 The SES brand assets that are not otherwise packaged: the GRUB boot theme and the
 Sora brand font. Installing or upgrading this package re-applies the current brand
 to the running system (regenerates the GRUB menu and refreshes the font cache), so
 branding updates arrive over apt without a reinstall. Headless Sysible Server ships
 no desktop, so the GDM login background and application icons are omitted.
